aptistery.","work":"Pulpit of Pisa Baptistery","artist":"Nicola Pisano","priority":4,"proof":"Pisa Baptistery","format":"single_choice","kind":"author_work_reverse","sourceType":"curated_pdf","nodeId":"PDF33-FACT-009"},{"id":"PDF33-Q010-A","source":"STORIA DELL_ARTE.it.en.pdf","page":47,"group":"medieval-art","major":"Art History","era":"Medieval","stem":"Who was commissioned to make the pulpit of Siena Cathedral in 1265?","choices":["Giovanni Pisano","Benedetto Antelami","Nicola Pisano","Wiligelmo","Giotto"],"answer":"Nicola Pisano","explanation":"Nicola Pisano and his workshop made the Siena Cathedral pulpit in 1265–1268. Giovanni Pisano assisted; he was not the commissioned master.","work":"Pulpit of Siena Cathedral","artist":"Nicola Pisano","priority":4,"proof":"Siena Cathedral","format":"single_choice","kind":"author_work","sourceType":"curated_pdf","nodeId":"PDF33-FACT-010","verificationUrl":"https://operaduomo.siena.it/news/presentazione-del-restauro-del-pulpito-di-nicola-pisano/"},{"id":"PDF33-Q010-B","source":"STORIA DELL_ARTE.it.en.pdf","page":47,"group":"medieval-art","major":"Art History","era":"Medieval","stem":"Which of these works was commissioned from Nicola Pisano in 1265?","choices":["Pulpit of Siena Cathedral","Rucellai Madonna","Genesis reliefs at Modena Cathedral","Deposition at Parma Cathedral","Crucifix at San Domenico"],"answer":"Pulpit of Siena Cathedral","explanation":"Nicola Pisano and his workshop made the Siena Cathedral pulpit in 1265–1268. Giovanni Pisano assisted; he was not the commissioned master.","work":"Pulpit of Siena Cathedral","artist":"Nicola Pisano","priority":4,"proof":"Siena Cathedral","format":"single_choice","kind":"author_work_reverse","sourceType":"curated_pdf","nodeId":"PDF33-FACT-010","verificationUrl":"https://operaduomo.siena.it/news/presentazione-del-restauro-del-pulpito-di-nicola-pisano/"},{"id":"PDF33-Q011-A","source":"STORIA DELL_ARTE.it.en.pdf","page":48,"group":"medieval-art","major":"Art History","era":"Medi