é Fragonard","priority":4,"proof":"The reader","format":"single_choice","kind":"author_work","sourceType":"curated_pdf","nodeId":"PDF33-FACT-058"},{"id":"PDF33-Q058-B","source":"STORIA DELL_ARTE.it.en.pdf","page":79,"group":"eighteenth-art","major":"Art History","era":"Early modern","stem":"Which of these works is associated with Jean-Honoré Fragonard?","choices":["The Reader","Marriage A-la-Mode","Oath of the Horatii","The Basin of San Marco","The Embarkation for Cythera"],"answer":"The Reader","explanation":"Jean-Honoré Fragonard created The Reader.","work":"The Reader","artist":"Jean-Honoré Fragonard","priority":4,"proof":"The reader","format":"single_choice","kind":"author_work_reverse","sourceType":"curated_pdf","nodeId":"PDF33-FACT-058"},{"id":"PDF33-Q059-A","source":"STORIA DELL_ARTE.it.en.pdf","page":79,"group":"eighteenth-art","major":"Art History","era":"Early modern","stem":"The work Marriage A-la-Mode is attributed to which artist?","choices":["William Hogarth","Jean-Antoine Watteau","Jacques-Louis David","Canaletto","Jean-Honoré Fragonard"],"answer":"William Hogarth","explanation":"William Hogarth created Marriage A-la-Mode.","work":"Marriage A-la-Mode","artist":"William Hogarth","priority":4,"proof":"Fashionable wedding","format":"single_choice","kind":"author_work","sourceType":"curated_pdf","nodeId":"PDF33-FACT-059"},{"id":"PDF33-Q059-B","source":"STORIA DELL_ARTE.it.en.pdf","page":79,"group":"eighteenth-art","major":"Art History","era":"Early modern","stem":"Which of these works is associated with William Hogarth?","choices":["Marriage A-la-Mode","The Reader","The Basin of San Marco","The Death of Marat","Oath of the Horatii"],"answer":"Marriage A-la-Mode","explanation":"William Hogarth created Marriage A-la-Mode.","work":"Marriage A-la-Mode","artist":"William Hogarth","priority":4,"proof":"Fashionable wedding","format":"single_choice","kind":"author_work_reverse","sourceType":"curated_pdf","nodeId":"PDF33-FACT-059"},{"id":"PDF33-Q060-A","source":"S